 CallServer;clt;petApi;res;req;pets;pet2
⍝ Compile and import api classes then run some tests
 Init
⍝ Make some calls to a local PetStore server
 clt←##.##.HttpCommand.New''
 clt.BaseURL←'http://localhost:8092/v2'
 petApi←#.TestClasses.PetstoreExpanded.paths
⍝ get all pets
 ⎕←⎕JSON res←clt petApi.Pets.Get''
⍝ create a dog named Swiffy
 req←petApi.Pets.NewPostRequestBody
 req.name←'Swiffy'
 req.tag←'dogs'
 ⎕←⎕JSON res←clt petApi.Pets.Post req
⍝ create a cat named Toffee
 req.name←'Toffee'
 req.tag←'cats'
 ⎕←⎕JSON res←clt petApi.Pets.Post req
⍝ create a horse named Buster
 req.name←'Buster'
 req.tag←'horses'
 ⎕←⎕JSON res←clt petApi.Pets.Post req
⍝ create a cat named Pixie
 req.name←'Pixie'
 req.tag←'cats'
 ⎕←⎕JSON res←clt petApi.Pets.Post req
⍝ get all cats
 ⎕←⎕JSON res←clt petApi.Pets.Get⊂'cats'
⍝ get all dogs and horses
 ⎕←⎕JSON res←clt petApi.Pets.Get⊂'dogs' 'horses'
⍝ get all cats and dogs limit to 2 pets
 ⎕←⎕JSON res←clt petApi.Pets.Get('cats' 'dogs')2
 pets←3⊃res
⍝ get second pet
 pet2←2⊃pets
 ⎕←⎕JSON res←clt petApi.PetsKey.Get pet2.id
⍝ delete pet
 ⎕←⎕JSON res←clt petApi.PetsKey.Delete pet2.id
⍝ get all pets
 ⎕←⎕JSON res←clt petApi.Pets.Get''

⍝ Remove api classes
 #.⎕EX'TestClasses'
⍝
